 "text": "Me and my kid are rebooting the Jaws series. Here's every plot from Jaws 5 to Jaws 10. Jaws 5 and Jaws 6 had nearly perfect audience scores, but Jaws 6 took a hit with the critics. One guy said, it's just Jaws 5 but under a bookstore. Okay, buddy, but then we learned that the shocks are not to be radioactive now jaws 7 Are you ready? Let's go. We got another line of shocks, but this time Police Chief Brody, played by Pedro Pascal, hops in his mechanical shock sub, blends in, and follows the shocks out of the cave, way into deep water. And at the end of the line, he finds A giant frickin' nuclear submarine. And guess who it is? It's the frickin' Russians! Brody gets on a plane, flies to DC, walks right into the White House and says, Mr. President, played by Tom Brady, the Russians are making radioactive mutant sharks and attacking my island. I need backup. So the President sends his top CIA officer, played by Rob Gronkowski, to Amity Island. And they go looking for the sub. But it's gone. And all that's left is a radioactive trail. They follow it up the coast, all the way to Maine, and capture the whole crew. But first, they jam the radios. So Russia has no idea. They keep one Russian guy on board to make it look normal. And then Police Chief Brody, Jesse, and Gronk hop into the submarine. Brody looks back and says, boys, we're going to Russia. And that sets us up for Jaws 8.",
